# The Stylistic Slope: Algorithmic Homogenization and the Decolonization of Literary AI

This repository contains the replication package and methodological framework for the paper: *"The Stylistic Slope: Algorithmic Homogenization and the Decolonization of Literary AI"*.

## Project Overview
This research investigates the "Stylistic Slope" in Large Language Models (LLMs), identifying a systematic failure to replicate the linguistic nuance of high-context, non-Western literary traditions. Through a quantitative stylometric analysis, we demonstrate how algorithmic homogenization flattens global literary diversity.

